== diagnostics ==
warning[W0901]: `==` and `!=` on `float` compare bits exactly
 --> app/app.veld:4:14
  |
4 |   rule same: a == b
  |              ^^^^^^
  = help: compare with `<` and `>` against a bound, or use `decimal`

warning[W0901]: `==` and `!=` on `float` compare bits exactly
 --> app/app.veld:5:17
  |
5 |   rule differs: a != 0.5
  |                 ^^^^^^^^
  = help: compare with `<` and `>` against a bound, or use `decimal`

